00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:01.980
Nothing, Claudia. It's a benefit.

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:06.030
All right, I'll do it.

00:13:07.030 --> 00:13:09.990
But no offense, Ross. I really think I need a new agent.

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:16.990
And after the concert, if you feel like dumping her off the Bay Bridge, that'd be completely cool with me, too.

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:24.570
Right when I'm about to tell her best friend when to be at Salinger, mom picks up the extension.

00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:27.830
But I don't think she heard. I think she'll still be surprised.

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:35.150
And then the aliens returned me to Earth to deliver their message to my leader.

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:38.110
DSK, I just can't figure out how you could not want to sleep with me.

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:39.510
