00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:03.400
I know, but...

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:05.380
Like my mom, she got divorced.

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:08.320
She'd go out with a guy and she'd like him, so she'd sleep with him.

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:09.960
And then a couple of months later, he'd be gone.

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:11.760
And then same thing would happen with someone else.

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:15.600
I mean, my God, after a while, it stops meaning anything at all.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:19.400
I promise it would mean something.

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:23.310
You mad?

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:25.720
